Package: opensketch
Title: Offline Scientific Figure Editor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Paul", family = "Heisig", email = "pkheisig@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8529-7944"))
Description: Launches a browser-based scientific figure editor bundled entirely
    inside the package. The editor uses public-domain biological artwork sourced
    from the NIAID NIH BioArt Source via Wikimedia Commons and supports local
    projects, vector editing, and publication-quality export without an account
    or remote application server.
URL: https://github.com/pkheisig/opensketch
BugReports: https://github.com/pkheisig/opensketch/issues
